index 000000000..4981f08b2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/LEAN/aperanton/Aperanton/TorusLCert3.lean
@@ -0,0 +1,160 @@
+/-
+  APERANTON -- THE BOUNDLESS, stage W6 (ADDENDUM I, THE ROAD): THE ECHELON CERTIFICATES OF THE FOUR-TORUS OF SIDE 3,
+  EMITTED by STDLIB/scripts/aperanton_emit_torusL.sh and DECIDED here -- the bases of the 324 link coboundaries (K), the
+  324 cube faces (D) and the faces with the six sheets, with their pivot bits and the two-way selection masks; every
+  clause a natural-number decide; the lists meet TorusL.lean's own masks at side 3 in `*_selG` (the emitter's
+  reproduction of the torus checked against Lean's, a sighted control); the geometry's own facts at this side decided
+  beside them (every link in six plaquettes, every plaquette on four links, every cube with six faces, the boundary of a
+  boundary zero, the six sheets cycles of L^2 plaquettes).  No sorry, no axiom, no native_decide.
+-/
+import Mathlib
+import Aperanton.Echelon
+import Aperanton.EchelonList
+import Aperanton.TorusL
+import Aperanton.TorusLocal
