+# THE FAR SHORE — every piece of evidence and progress toward the continuum gap, the remainder of the Yang–Mills problem past the strong-coupling boundary, scraped from both repositories, the tree's memory, its build directories and every scratchpad, each at its status and its site (Edwin Boston III, 2026-11-01 02:1x EST, read from `date`; the trunk seat iii-43; the operator's order of 01:5x)
