+> Status: a READING and a SORTING, written to the operator's order of 2026-11-01 01:5x ("before continuing, look through the repository and III project memory and files and scratchpad to scrape for ourselves every single bit of evidence and progress toward the remainder of Yang Mills"). THE COALESCENCE (OPEN/ledger/the-coalescence.md, 10-30) sorted everything PROVED except the continuum gap; THE CROSSING (OPEN/the-crossing.md, 10-29) stated the open part at its sharpest. This page is the third: everything in hand that bears on the REMAINDER — the proved chain it reduces to, the ultraviolet half's reduction, the crossover's walls as measured, the roads refuted with their killers, the objects built that pay in the window, the instruments, the readings of other hands, the one analytic stake found tonight inside the landed number, and the synthesis — so that no seat re-walks a dead road or re-measures a measured wall, and so that the next act is the one the evidence points at. Nothing above β = 0.4764 (the page dressing; 0.4816 in the tree dressing) is claimed; the continuum gap is not claimed; a desk argument here is a STAKE with its kill-switch, never a result.
